pi-dev-team
===========

This package implements a Pi coding-agent extension (`/devteam`).

Third-party material
--------------------

This product includes adapted copies of:

1. Skills originally published in https://github.com/mattpocock/skills (MIT License)
   Copyright (c) Matt Pocock
   See vendor-licenses/mattpocock-MIT.txt and the adaptation notes in each
   skills/*/SKILL.md file. The following skills were adapted: grilling, to-spec,
   to-tickets, codebase-design, tdd, implement, code-review, diagnosing-bugs.

2. The frontend-design skill from Anthropic's Claude Code plugins
   (Apache License 2.0). Copyright Anthropic.
   See skills/frontend-design/LICENSE.txt and skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md.

Official language and framework Agent Skills (Angular, React Native, Vue, .NET,
Neon Postgres, and others listed in catalog/stacks.json) are not redistributed
in this package. At run time they may be fetched into
`~/.pi/agent/devteam/skill-cache/` from their upstream git repositories.
